    {
        "id": "en:word:structure-as-soon-as",
        "label": "as soon as",
        "fields": {
            "part_of_speech": "conjunction",
            "pronunciation": ["/əz suːn əz/"],
            "audio": "audio/70cc4e22fd688323bc1c8e4d6891ccc9d78ddf050a4b56408349af8bfe8fae5a.wav",
            "reference_images": [
                "images/e21e7c67c42bf8373e819b119075e5a6df06b2ec0e7451635007c8025976b2d7.jpg"
            ],
            "usage_notes": {
                "en": "As soon as connects an event to an immediate response. Example: As soon as the bell rings, he opens the door. The arrow shows the order; the words express that there is no delay.",
                "de": "As soon as verbindet ein Ereignis mit einer unmittelbaren Reaktion. „As soon as the bell rings, he opens the door.“ = Sobald es klingelt, öffnet er die Tür. Der Pfeil zeigt die Reihenfolge; die Wörter drücken die Unmittelbarkeit aus.",
                "id": "As soon as menghubungkan kejadian dengan respons langsung. “As soon as the bell rings, he opens the door.” = Begitu bel berbunyi, dia membuka pintu. Panah menunjukkan urutan; kata-katanya menyatakan tanpa penundaan.",
                "ja": "as soon asは出来事の直後の反応を示します。「As soon as the bell rings, he opens the door.」＝ベルが鳴るとすぐに、彼はドアを開けます。矢印は順序を、言葉は間を置かないことを表します。"
            }
        },
        "class": "lexical:conjunction",
        "tags": ["conjunction", "sentence-structure", "grammar"],
